\f0\fs24 \cf0 <div id="roll-666" class="stanza-container"> \
    <h4 class="roll-header">Roll 6-6-6</h4> \
    <div class="stanza-flex"> \
        <div class="middle-english"> \
            <strong>\
                Middle English\
                <a href="https://digital.bodleian.ox.ac.uk/objects/ee2d3617-5696-4ec8-9e4d-a99d0c485019/surfaces/a6497d82-3238-49b3-bf44-96e6f17a5911/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="manuscript-icon-wrapper" title="View manuscript at Bodleian Libraries">\
                    <span class="manuscript-icon">\uc0\u55357 \u56540 </span>\
                </a>\
            </strong> \
            <p> To the orient perle as norisse is Cokille<br> Ryght so ben ye to al vertu the rote<br> In chastite as clere as is Berille<br> As synamome that ys of odour sote<br> So youre mekenesse ageyns al vice is bote<br> Who pleynly knoweth youre condicioun<br> To yow may be made no comparisoun </p> \
        </div> \
        <div class="modern-english"> \
            <strong>Modern English</strong> \
            <p> As the oyster is wetnurse to the Orient pearl<br> So you have been with virtue to the letter<br> As clear as beryl in your chastity<br> Like cinnamon which makes odors sweet<br> So your humility all vice relieves<br> You who knows plainly your condition<br> To you can be made no comparison </p> \
        </div> \
    </div> \
</div>\
\
<div id="roll-665" class="stanza-container">\
   <h4 class="roll-header">Roll 6-6-5</h4>\
   <div class="stanza-flex">\
      <div class="middle-english">\
         <strong>Middle English</strong>\
         <p>\
            To thenke vpon so double a creature<br>\
            Myn hande ashamed (ys) I may not write<br>\
            And in trouthe pleynly y yow ensure<br>\
            My tonge ne may sufficen for to endyte<br>\
            ffor vnto love ye do so grete dispite<br>\
            There Jason falseth oon ye falsen twoo<br>\
            Be god yet herde I neuer | of suche no moo\
         </p>\
      </div>\
      <div class="modern-english">\
         <strong>Modern English</strong>\
         <p>\
            Even thinking about someone so two-faced<br>\
            Made my hand ashamed now I can't write<br>\
            And honestly I can assure you<br>\
            My tongue can't even muster the sounds<br>\
            For unto love you do such great harm<br>\
            That where Jason spins a yarn, you spin two<br>\
            God willing I never hear about you again\
         </p>\
      </div>\
   </div>\
</div>\
\
<div id="roll-664" class="stanza-container">\
   <h4 class="roll-header">Roll 6-6-4</h4>\
   <div class="stanza-flex">\
      <div class="middle-english">\
         <strong>Middle English</strong>\
         <p>\
            The high renoun of youre grete lustynesse<br>\
            Youre stidfastnesse and youre assured trouthe<br>\
            Causen al folke that wole lerne gentilesse<br>\
            With honest dysport for to voyde slouthe<br>\
            Desire to be wyth yow but to moche routhe<br>\
            Yf ye duelle shulde oute of companye<br>\
            Sythe that youre bounte voydeth al folye\
         </p>\
      </div>\
      <div class="modern-english">\
         <strong>Modern English</strong>\
         <p>\
            The high renown of your lust for life<br>\
            Your steadfastness and your veracity<br>\
            Causes everyone who would put an honest effort<br>\
            Into learning nobility so as to avoid sloth<br>\
            To desire to be with you but to their great pity<br>\
            You should live without company<br>\
            Since your bounty is to avoid all folly\
         </p>\
      </div>\
   </div>\
</div>\
\
<div id="roll-663" class="stanza-container">\
   <h4 class="roll-header">Roll 6-6-3</h4>\
   <div class="stanza-flex">\
      <div class="middle-english">\
         <strong>Middle English</strong>\
         <p>\
            Ye casten fersly with goode countenaunce<br>\
            That ys no wonder for ye ben so bolde<br>\
            Bothe malapert and ful of ignoraunce<br>\
            Therwith youre wordes ye kan so queyntly folde<br>\
            What man on lyve yowe truste or leve sholde<br>\
            And yet therto in daunce whan ye shul trippe<br>\
            fforth vp and don | ye rekke not how ye hippe\
         </p>\
      </div>\
      <div class="modern-english">\
         <strong>Modern English</strong>\
         <p>\
            You cast fiercely with good acting<br>\
            It's no wonder since you've been so bold<br>\
            Both disrespectful and stupid<br>\
            That with your words you so<br>\
            What man alive would trust or believe you<br>\
            And yet when dancing you trip<br>\
            you go up and down and don't know which is which\
         </p>\
      </div>\
   </div>\
</div>}